// The designs STORE slice. It carries MODULE STATE (aiHydrateTimer, aiHydratePending) so it can never
// itself be a record — which is exactly why it has to be registered: `features/designs/index.ts`
// re-exports `createComponentsSlice` from it, and that barrel's record cannot load otherwise.
